		(property "Description" "Dual N-channel enhancement-mode power MOSFET (common drain), 20V/6A, used as the pair of battery-side switches driven by DW01A's OD/OC outputs in a standard single-cell Li-ion protection circuit. PART NUMBER NOTE: Fortune Semiconductor's own product literally named 'FS8205A' is a different TSSOP-8 part (see FS8205A-DS-17_EN) -- the SOT-23-6 device widely sold as 'FS8205A' by distributors (EVVOSEMI, Fuxinsemi, TECH PUBLIC and others) matches Fortune Semiconductor's real 'FS8205' (no trailing A) SOT-23-6 datasheet Rev 1.9 exactly, independently cross-checked against Fuxinsemi's own FS8205A SOT-23-6 datasheet (identical physical pin arrangement in both). Pin numbers verified: 1=S1, 2=D12 (common drain, D1=D2 internally), 3=S2, 4=G2, 5=D12 (common drain, same net as pin 2), 6=G1."
			(at 0 0 0)
